# Windsurf IDE Project Rules: Blood Donation Network (BDN)

# Code Quality & Standards
- Enforce strict TypeScript typing across frontend and backend codebases.
- Frontend components must follow React 18 / Next.js 14 App Router standards.
- Backend services must adhere to the 4-layer architecture defined in ARCHITECTURE.md.

# Domain Principles
- Emergency blood request matching MUST use PostGIS spatial distance queries (`ST_DWithin`).
- Enforce clinical blood compatibility rules (ABO/Rh matrix) and 56-day whole blood donor cooldowns.
- Maintain PII confidentiality; obfuscate donor identity until explicit match acceptance.

# Documentation Compliance
- Always verify changes against AGENTS.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, and API_SPEC.md.
- Keep DATABASE.md in sync with any schema migrations.
